        <section id="return_values" props="android cpp ios mac">
            <title>Return Values</title>
            <p props="cpp">If the method call succeeds, returns the current playback position in milliseconds.</p>
            <p props="android">If the method call succeeds, returns the current playback position in milliseconds.</p>
        <p props="ios mac">If the method call succeeds, returns the current playback position in milliseconds.</p>
